### ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW

```
Prewarm Leader (elected — runs on one replica only)
        │
        ▼
Discovers all applications
Batches them into the Redis Stream (XADD)
One message per application per prewarm cycle
        │
        ▼
Redis Stream: streams:discovery:operations
Consumer Group: telark-discovery-consumer-group
        │
   ┌────┴────┐
   ▼         ▼
Replica-1  Replica-2   (XREADGROUP — one message per replica)
   │
   ▼
Acquire per-app distributed lock
   │
   ├── lock not acquired → NACK, leave in PEL, retry
   │
   └── lock acquired → discover what this app needs:
                         change detection?
                         snapshot creation?
                         rollback execution?
                       (agent reads existing prewarm logic to determine this)
                       Execute each needed operation in sequence.
                       Update operation state at each step.
                       Release lock on completion or failure.

Enrich API (HTTP handler — separate from prewarm)
   │
   └── per-app lock → process enrichment → release lock
                   └── 409 if lock not acquired
```

